{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.poster.avif?t=1765634607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.webm?t=1765634607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Coins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byte Coin -</strong> The OG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as stable as FliptoCurrencies get, but less swings means less opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/6437924e681dfd1c0ab45c5ee6830a4b.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Coin -</strong> The New Hotness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can do anything Byte Coin can do, not quite as well but with much more pizzazz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/2ba5be972e593a263b9c90b9172304db.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterium</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> The Enigma. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind that deep, dark eye? He'll never tell...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/d4f90f2124efe8a1fbce7db20830b24c.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doggo Coin -</strong> The Meme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dogs are great! Pictures of dogs are great! Digital representation of pictures of dogs are definitely a sound investment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ce4baeb33c56ab14e5ab72ddf9f906e9.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 13 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Disclaimer: no real blockchain technology was involved in the making of this game. Honestly, I don't really even understand how that stuff works</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/e83090bdf05afdf4b053b00e419a56c3459d6b0d.jpg"},{"name":"Trainee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/f684c3e2e1cbc5966c2970f3d1ea9d6248f3732d.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Associate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/5c40175fa2c2116925567b44b483da969dc34962.jpg"},{"name":"Associate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/06c0ef08108e3506179443f19df205698e84f776.jpg"},{"name":"Assistant Manager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/4d85d4cac0e8e470b638640df902ab13f8cbda35.jpg"},{"name":"Manager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/5f07f8be986addc9a7c732f1667604232209f233.jpg"},{"name":"Director","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/9fe74f83f3865ff33a4bbcc355a95405e88b937a.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Vice President","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/97c06fe47839d011487dbcb2d8c72157f6ca21a2.jpg"},{"name":"Vice President","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/19b990d5fc7ebf40db5da263e9e739bc3eaa065d.jpg"},{"name":"Chief Executive Officer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623480/d5437c6adc0d0576739ae3c11b8535a7c08fb31e.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623480?t=1765634607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/02d5fdacdae3c7e0e598027d8b47981cb095248c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765634607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/